{"ID":"20240118151013-llfvu43","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151013-llfvu43","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151013-llfvu43\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151013-u58pogc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153135-crekc6h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122153135-crekc6h\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:395,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:395\u0026#125;","title":"288泽漆（大戟苗）","type":"doc","updated":"20240204102916"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151013-u58pogc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151013-u58pogc","updated":"20240122153111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，微寒，无毒。治皮肤热，大腹水气，四肢面目浮肿，丈夫阴气不足，生川泽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153113-r1u0saj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153113-r1u0saj"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】产江湖原泽，处处有之，绿叶绿花，茎有白汁粘人，故曰泽漆。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153115-w8ug3rx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153115-w8ug3rx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，性微寒，无毒（或作小毒）。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153116-zvx38tm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153116-zvx38tm"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】泽漆主治水肿脚肿，消痰退热，敷之消疣。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153118-bbfnnlf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153118-bbfnnlf"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】利大小肠，明目。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153119-6gvbwgh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153119-6gvbwgh"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】止疟疾，消痰，退热。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153120-ci6mtak","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153120-ci6mtak"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153121-87b0oib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153121-87b0oib"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】赤小豆为使，恶薯蓣。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122153111-rxgqqtj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153111-rxgqqtj"}},{"ID":"20240122153121-y2rcag0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153121-y2rcag0"}},{"ID":"20240122153122-pl25f5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153122-pl25f5q","updated":"20240204102223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再来呢，288，泽漆，经方里面呢有泽漆汤，我们要用到泽漆，那泽漆其实就是大戟的苗，大戟的小苗，如果找不到泽漆，你用大戟就可以了，哦，也是一个排水的药。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153128-twqm5uj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153128-twqm5uj","updated":"20240204102328"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本草经的原文：泽漆味苦，治皮肤热，大腹水气，肚子里面积水，四肢面目浮肿用的药。具有白色粘液的药都是属于毒药的哦，诸位看，主治：泽漆主治水肿脚肿，消炎(应为”痰”)退热，敷之消疣。外敷的时候，可以，皮肤上的疣它都可以去掉，那水肿，脚肿，我们会用到大戟，就是泽漆苗。那下半身的水肿的时候，单纯性的水肿，我们用这种攻水的药，这种峻药，会攻水的药，都是紧急的时候、危险的时候使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240122153135-crekc6h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122153135-crekc6h","updated":"20240204102916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般来说，都是开一剂就够了，开完的时候，病人的元气虚，你开些补药把他身体补回来，让水能够汽化，那水在汽化的时候，它水又回来，你再开第二剂下去，清掉，一般来说一剂就够了，有时候用到第二剂，那是因为，我常常讲那是病人不知道，就算知道也会怕，只有这个时候忌盐，等到正常以后再吃也没有关系，所以你会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"补药和攻药同时在使用，但是不会放在同一个方子里边，比如你攻药早上吃完攻药，中午，晚上，要吃滋补药"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不会把这些，比如你开完十全大补汤，又开了这个十枣汤，你不会说把十全大补汤和大枣汤混在一起吃，先吃完十全大补汤，因为先吃完十枣汤，可能吐泄都完了，正常了再给他吃十全大补，不然你吃下也吐光了，对不对，那个补药统统吐到那个sink、那个水槽里边去了，对不对，没有用，身体不受，专门治疗这个水肿，诸位考虑到这点，那，（禁忌），一般来说，我们用赤小豆配合他来使用，这个大戟的力量非常地峻，非常地强。这是大戟的苗，使用的时候要小心，一再告诫你要小心。"}]}]}